{%- comment -%}
  Prime WhatsApp (2026-11-15): replaces the paid Dondy WhatsApp app (6.99 $/month, ~64 KB of JS) with a plain link,
  no JavaScript. Same look and behaviour as the Dondy bubble it replaces: green 55 px circle, bottom-right
  (10 px from the right, 90 px from the bottom so it clears the sticky add-to-cart bar), opens WhatsApp with
  "Buna ziua, doresc mai multe informații." + the link of the page the visitor is on.
  Until the visitor makes a cookie choice it stays hidden (same rule as snippets/consent-overlays.liquid had for Dondy),
  so it never covers the Pandectes cookie bar on phones.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign wa_number = '40775286584' -%}
{%- capture wa_text %}Buna ziua, doresc mai multe informații.

{{ canonical_url }}{% endcapture -%}
{%- assign wa_text = wa_text | url_encode | replace: '+', '%20' -%}
<a
  class="prime-wa"
  href="https://wa.me/{{ wa_number }}?text={{ wa_text }}"
  target="_blank"
  rel="noopener"
  aria-label="Scrie-ne pe WhatsApp"
  title="Scrie-ne pe WhatsApp"
>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" width="31" height="31" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
